  "analytic": [
    "The simple old-plus-first-foreign path and chronological FIRST returned contact give a Jordan loop from the outgoing old source contact along the actual old/foreign arc, then the initial returned segment. The signed local foreign/returned interface rules out any extra intersection with repaired foreign pieces. No continuation beyond first contact is used.",
    "The signed n=3 plus one-foreign principal tangent lift is5 quarter-turn units plus alpha_return-alpha_source. Closing the actual NW-to-NE contact subtracts1 quarter for C and1/2+atan3/(pi/2) for V. Both yield +4, so the Jordan loop is CCW. The true preceding-C bit is zero by actual complete-eight/foreign adjacency, so no missing negative wrap is suppressed.",
    "At an old source vertex, same-point contact with its incoming atom is allowed and owned by the outgoing source. Every actual incoming D/V/U/C reverse ray lies strictly in the reflex interior. At a D midpoint the preceding half-D lies strictly inside. At old C1 the creating-D SW ray lies inside. The connected earlier old prefix has no further boundary contact by old simplicity and FIRST-contact, hence its entirety is inside. This is an actual finite-prefix argument, not an exterior-wire or arbitrary coloring inference.",
    "Whole-loop support is derived from literal atom signs for ALL run lengths. Before C1 N heads are nondecreasing in y; W heads are at least2; after W->S and S->E, S/E heads decrease toward the foreign target. Corrected-center offsets preserve bounds at every atomic vertex, including internal C tails. Real F56/Qtail/Btail vertices give exact minima; straight segments cannot dip below their endpoints. Jordan interior is STRICTLY above the supporting line.",
    "The preceding maximal zero-C N run has positive height d+3v+4u, so its starting center -1-2height must exceed the exact support. If no previous C exists, the factor initial genuine U base contributes at least4 and contradicts that inequality. Thus a real positive-C full packet precedes the bounded run; its earlier history remains arbitrary. The last C is its actual final tail, not a fictitious internal marker.",
    "D15 support-9 bounds only preceding N-run weight<=3: empty,D,DD,DDD,V. D30 support-7 bounds weight<=2: empty,D,DD. Five possible last-positive-C full packets give40 necessary boundary interfaces. Source containing D versus DC does not change the pre-D run. No earlier-clock bound, full exclusion or attainment is obtained."
  ],
